<section class=3D"slide" id=3D"s3">
  <span class=3D"slide-tag">PART I =C2=B7 MOTIVATION</span>
  <h1 class=3D"slide-title">RAG works <em>until it doesn't</em></h1>
  <p class=3D"lede">
    A naive RAG pipeline has at least 14 hyperparameters spread across 6 st=
ages. Tune one, the others shift. Hand-engineering each is a combinatorial =
nightmare.
  </p>

  <div class=3D"grid-3">
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">01 =E2=80=94 INGESTION</div>
      <h4>Chunking strategy</h4>
      <p>Token vs. recursive vs. semantic. Window size 256 / 512 / 1024. Ov=
erlap 0=E2=80=9350%. Each shifts retrieval distribution.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">02 =E2=80=94 INDEX</div>
      <h4>Embedding choice</h4>
      <p>BGE, E5, OpenAI, Cohere, Voyage. Different geometries, different r=
ecall ceilings.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">03 =E2=80=94 RETRIEVAL</div>
      <h4>Hybrid weights</h4>
      <p>BM25 vs. dense. Top-k. RRF k-constant. Query rewriting on/off.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">04 =E2=80=94 RERANK</div>
      <h4>Cross-encoder?</h4>
      <p>Cohere rerank, BGE-reranker, ColBERT. Latency-vs-recall tradeoff.<=
/p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">05 =E2=80=94 PROMPT</div>
      <h4>Template format</h4>
      <p>Few-shot count. Citation style. Refusal scaffolding. Order of cont=
ext.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">06 =E2=80=94 GENERATION</div>
      <h4>Model + decoding</h4>
      <p>Sonnet vs. Opus vs. open. Temperature. Reasoning budget. Self-cons=
istency.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"callout" style=3D"margin-top:32px;">
    The combinatorial space is roughly $|C| \times |E| \times |R| \times |M=
| \times |T| \times |G| \approx 10^7$ configurations. You cannot grid-searc=
h this by hand.
  </div>
  <div class=3D"slide-num">03 / 44</div>
</section>

