of swappable nodes</strong>. Given an evaluation dataset $\mathcal{D} =3D \=
{(q_i, a_i^*, \text{ctx}_i^*)\}_{i=3D1}^{N}$, it searches the configuration=
 space $\Theta$ for the pipeline $\pi^* \in \Pi$ that maximizes a composite=
 metric.
