    <p style=3D"font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-dim); margin-top:14px;">
      Bi-encoders embed $q$ and $d$ independently (fast, lossy). Cross-enco=
ders attend $q$=E2=86=94$d$ jointly (slow, accurate). Typical pattern: bi-e=
ncoder retrieves top-100, cross-encoder reranks to top-5.
    </p>
