=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D -->
<section class=3D"slide" id=3D"s7">
  <span class=3D"slide-tag">AUTORAG =C2=B7 GENERATION</span>
  <h1 class=3D"slide-title">Prompts are <em>parameters</em></h1>

  <p class=3D"body">In AutoRAG, the prompt template itself is part of the s=
earch space. The generator node accepts a list of templates and a list of L=
LMs; the search algorithm picks the cartesian-product winner under the metr=
ic.</p>

  <pre class=3D"code"><span class=3D"kw">prompt_maker</span>:
  modules:
    - module_type: fstring
      prompt:
        - <span class=3D"str">"Answer using ONLY the passages below.\n\n{re=
trieved_contents}\n\nQ: {query}\nA:"</span>
        - <span class=3D"str">"You are an ESG analyst. Cite passages by [n]=
.\n\n{retrieved_contents}\n\nQuestion: {query}"</span>
    - module_type: long_context_reorder
    - module_type: window_replacement

<span class=3D"kw">generator</span>:
  modules:
    - module_type: <span class=3D"fn">llama_index_llm</span>
      llm: [openai, anthropic, vllm]
      model: [gpt-4o-mini, claude-sonnet-4-6, Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct]
      temperature: [0.0, 0.3]
      batch: 16</pre>

  <div class=3D"callout">
    Insight: the <em>order</em> of retrieved passages matters. <code>long_c=
ontext_reorder</code> places highest-relevance passages at the head and tai=
l to mitigate the lost-in-the-middle effect (Liu et al., 2023).
  </div>
  <div class=3D"slide-num">07 / 44</div>
</section>

