<section class=3D"slide" id=3D"s13">
  <span class=3D"slide-tag">DSPY =C2=B7 MODULES</span>
  <h1 class=3D"slide-title">Modules compose into <em>programs</em></h1>

  <p class=3D"body">DSPy modules are PyTorch-flavored: subclass <code>dspy.=
Module</code>, declare predictors in <code>__init__</code>, define <code>fo=
rward</code>. They compose freely.</p>

  <pre class=3D"code"><span class=3D"kw">class</span> <span class=3D"cls">R=
AGProgram</span>(dspy.<span class=3D"cls">Module</span>):
    <span class=3D"kw">def</span> <span class=3D"fn">__init__</span>(self, =
k=3D<span class=3D"num">5</span>):
        <span class=3D"kw">super</span>().<span class=3D"fn">__init__</span=
>()
        self.retrieve =3D dspy.<span class=3D"cls">Retrieve</span>(k=3Dk)
        self.refine_query =3D dspy.<span class=3D"cls">ChainOfThought</span=
>(<span class=3D"str">"question -&gt; refined_query"</span>)
        self.generate =3D dspy.<span class=3D"cls">ChainOfThought</span>(<s=
pan class=3D"cls">RAGAnswer</span>)

    <span class=3D"kw">def</span> <span class=3D"fn">forward</span>(self, q=
uestion):
        rq  =3D self.<span class=3D"fn">refine_query</span>(question=3Dques=
tion).refined_query
        ctx =3D self.<span class=3D"fn">retrieve</span>(rq).passages
        out =3D self.<span class=3D"fn">generate</span>(context=3Dctx, ques=
tion=3Dquestion)
        <span class=3D"kw">return</span> dspy.<span class=3D"cls">Predictio=
n</span>(answer=3Dout.answer, citations=3Dout.citations, ctx=3Dctx)

<span class=3D"com"># Built-in predictor types:</span>
<span class=3D"com"># - dspy.Predict         (single-pass)</span>
<span class=3D"com"># - dspy.ChainOfThought  (adds `reasoning` field)</span=
>
<span class=3D"com"># - dspy.ProgramOfThought (executes generated Python)</=
span>
<span class=3D"com"># - dspy.ReAct           (tools + reasoning loop)</span=
>
<span class=3D"com"># - dspy.MultiChainComparison  (self-consistency)</span=
></pre>

  <h3 class=3D"sub" style=3D"margin-top:24px;">What DSPy tracks for each pr=
edictor</h3>
  <ul class=3D"tech-list">
    <li><strong>Instruction</strong> =E2=80=94 the textual task description=
 (mutable by optimizers)</li>
    <li><strong>Demonstrations</strong> =E2=80=94 few-shot examples (select=
ed/synthesized by optimizers)</li>
    <li><strong>Format hints</strong> =E2=80=94 output schema directives</l=
i>
    <li><strong>Adapter</strong> =E2=80=94 how the signature is rendered fo=
r a specific LM (Chat, JSON, completion)</li>
  </ul>
  <div class=3D"slide-num">13 / 44</div>
</section>

