compiled =3D tp.<span class=3D"fn">compile</span>(student=3Dprogram, trains=
et=3Dtrainset)</pre>

    <p class=3D"body">SIMBA is the right pick when you have a continuous da=
ta stream and want the program to keep adapting without full re-compilation=
. Lower variance than COPRO, lower cost than MIPROv2.</p>
