<!-- SLIDE 35 =E2=80=94 Faithfulness diagnosis                             =
-->
<!-- =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D -->
<section class=3D"slide" id=3D"s35">
  <span class=3D"slide-tag">FAILURE MODE =C2=B7 FAITHFULNESS</span>
  <h1 class=3D"slide-title">Faithfulness <em>degrades</em> after compilatio=
n =E2=80=94 why?</h1>

  <p class=3D"body">A common production observation: BLEU/ROUGE/answer-corr=
ectness rise after MIPROv2, but RAGAS-faithfulness drops. The optimizer lea=
rned to <em>infer</em> from limited context, which improves apparent qualit=
y but increases hallucination.</p>

  <div class=3D"grid-2">
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">DIAGNOSIS</div>
      <h4>The metric was wrong</h4>
      <p>Pure semantic similarity rewards plausible-sounding answers. The o=
ptimizer exploits this by being <em>more confident</em>, even when context =
is insufficient.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">FIX 1</div>
      <h4>Composite metric with faithfulness floor</h4>
      <p>$\mu =3D \alpha\cdot\text{ans} + \beta\cdot\text{faith},\quad \mu =
\to 0\text{ if faith} &lt; 0.7$</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">FIX 2</div>
      <h4>Add a refusal predictor</h4>
      <p>Insert a <code>can_answer:bool</code> ChainOfThought stage. Only g=
enerate if true. Train on counterfactual "unanswerable" examples.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"num">FIX 3</div>
      <h4>Constrained instruction</h4>
      <p>In the signature docstring, require: "If any claim is not entailed=
 by passages, say 'context insufficient'." MIPROv2 will preserve this const=
raint while tuning around it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <pre class=3D"code"><span class=3D"kw">def</span> <span class=3D"fn">fait=
h_floored_metric</span>(ex, pred, trace=3D<span class=3D"kw">None</span>):
    faith =3D <span class=3D"fn">faithfulness</span>(pred, ex.context)
    <span class=3D"kw">if</span> faith &lt; <span class=3D"num">0.7</span>:=
 <span class=3D"kw">return</span> <span class=3D"num">0.0</span>           =
<span class=3D"com"># hard penalty</span>
    ans =3D <span class=3D"fn">semantic_sim</span>(pred.answer, ex.answer)
    <span class=3D"kw">return</span> <span class=3D"num">0.5</span>*faith +=
 <span class=3D"num">0.5</span>*ans</pre>
  <div class=3D"slide-num">35 / 44</div>
</section>

