  <h3 class=3D"sub" style=3D"margin-top:32px;">Sanity-check checklist</h3>
  <ul class=3D"tech-list">
    <li><strong>Calibration:</strong> compiled program should beat zero-sho=
t on test by =E2=89=A5 optimizer's variance on val (3 seed runs).</li>
    <li><strong>Robustness:</strong> swap the LM at inference. If quality c=
ollapses, you over-fit to model-specific quirks.</li>
    <li><strong>Distribution shift:</strong> hold out a "domain shift" test=
 slice (different topic, language, format).</li>
    <li><strong>Cost regression:</strong> track tokens/query as well as qua=
lity. MIPROv2 sometimes adds long demos.</li>
    <li><strong>Faithfulness floor:</strong> compute RAGAS-faith on test ev=
en if not in your composite metric.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class=3D"slide-num">36 / 44</div>
</section>

